
---
import Layout from '../layouts/BlogPost.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="About Just Scribles"
  description="A personal space for thoughts, ideas, experiments, and things worth exploring."
  pubDate={new Date('2026-11-19')}
>
  <div class="about-page">
    <p class="about-intro">
      Thoughts, Without a filter.
    </p>

    <p>
      Just Scribles is a space to think out loud, explore ideas,
 document experiments, and share things worth thinking about. </p>

    <h2>Why this blog exists</h2>

    <p>
      The internet is full of information, opinions, and endless content.
      I wanted a small corner of it where I could write without worrying
      about algorithms, trends, or getting everything perfect.
    </p>

    <p>
      Writing helps turn scattered thoughts into something meaningful.
      Some posts might be technical, some might be personal, and others
      might simply be observations about things I find interesting.
    </p>

    <h2>What you'll find here</h2>

    <ul>
      <li>Technology, software development, and open source.</li>
      <li>Projects, experiments, and things I learn while building.</li>
      <li>Ideas about the internet, entrepreneurship, and creativity.</li>
      <li>Personal reflections and observations.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>A work in progress</h2>

    <p>
      This blog will evolve as I do. My opinions may change, projects
      may fail, and some ideas may lead somewhere unexpected.
      That's part of the process.
    </p>

    <p>
      No particular niche. No pressure to be an expert.
      Just a place to think, write, and share.
    </p>

    <p class="about-signoff">
      Thanks for stopping by.
    </p>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .about-intro {
    font-size: 1.35rem;
    font-weight: 650;
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  .about-signoff {
    margin-top: 2rem;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
</style>
